  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/660/660-30.htm",
  "statuteText": "660:30 Compensation. –\n\nEach elector shall be paid $3; and each shall receive $.10 a mile for their travel to and from Concord. Also, the electors shall be allowed a reasonable sum, not to exceed $25, to pay for the services of a secretary."
